        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "导入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import a 3D .cube with a 0–1 input range. Input and output must both use the selected SDR color space. Camera Log, HDR and 1D shaper LUTs must first be converted to an sRGB-to-sRGB look in a color-managed editor. A .cube file cannot reliably identify its color space. Existing imports keep their sRGB interpretation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Import a 3D .cube with a 0–1 input range. Input and output must both use the selected SDR color space. Camera Log, HDR and 1D shaper LUTs must first be converted to an sRGB-to-sRGB look in a color-managed editor. A .cube file cannot reliably identify its color space. Existing imports keep their sRGB interpretation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请导入输入范围为 0–1 的 3D .cube，输入和输出均需使用所选 SDR 颜色空间。相机 Log、HDR 及带 1D 整形的 LUT，需先在支持色彩管理的编辑器中转换为 sRGB 输入、sRGB 输出的风格 LUT。仅凭 .cube 文件无法可靠识别颜色空间。已有导入继续按 sRGB 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
